{"type": "step", "node_id": 27, "parent_node_id": 26, "role": "assistant", "content": "## 解法\n\n控制方程为：\n\n$$2(X - 10) = \\frac{1}{2}(80) + 20$$\n\n**第一步：计算右侧。**\n\n$$\\frac{1}{2}(80) + 20 = 40 + 20 = 60$$\n\n因此方程变为：\n\n$$2(X - 10) = 60$$\n\n**第二步：两边同除以 2。**\n\n$$X - 10 = 30$$\n\n**第三步：两边同加 10。**\n\n$$X = 40$$\n\n**第四步：验证候选芯片值。**\n\n将 $X = 40$ 代入原方程：\n\n- 左边：$2(40 - 10) = 2(30) = 60$\n- 右边：$\\frac{1}{2}(80) + 20 = 40 + 20 = 60$\n\n两边相等，方程平衡。\n\n检查其他候选值：\n- $X = 30$：左边 $= 2(20) = 40 \\neq 60$\n- $X = 50$：左边 $= 2(40) = 80 \\neq 60$\n- $X = 60$：左边 $= 2(50) = 100 \\neq 60$\n\n只有 $X = 40$ 能使方程平衡。\n\n**结论：** 技术人员必须输入的芯片值为 **40**。\n\n### PROOF COMPLETE", "thinking": "Let me solve the equation directly in my thinking.\n\nThe equation: 2(X - 10) = (1/2)(80) + 20\n\nRight side: (1/2)(80) + 20 = 40 + 20 = 60\n\nSo: 2(X - 10) = 60\nX - 10 = 30\nX = 40\n\nThe answer is 40.\n\nNo answer leak detected. Let me write the proof.", "tool_calls": [], "created_at": 1787226743}
